    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51078" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσολύμπιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like those rendered to the
				Olympians</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.181
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				567
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ranking with the Olympic games</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγὼν] γυμνικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					630.13
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).506.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Nicuria</span>), etc.</div>
